data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":89,"item_id":"rs_00d20d1b08180855016acb5a71672487d18dba1684b5007298","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test coverage**\n\nI need to ensure I write enough tests to cover everything comprehensively. It's important to spawn the tests correctly and import necessary modules or functions. Ensuring thorough testing means I can catch potential errors or issues early on. I might need to review what I've already written and consider if it’s sufficient. There’s definitely a balance to strike between quantity and quality in test writing! So, I’ll make sure I'm covering all bases."}

